%% section: Deep dives
flowchart TB
    U["Client has a 5 GB file"] --> C["Split into fixed-size chunks"]
    C --> H["Hash each chunk"]
    H --> Q{"Server already has this hash?"}
    Q -->|"Yes"| S["Skip it — this is the dedupe win"]
    Q -->|"No"| P["Presigned PUT straight to object storage"]
    P --> M["Commit a manifest: ordered chunk hashes"]
    S --> M
    M --> R{"Resume after a dropped connection"}
    R --> RA["Re-ask which chunks are missing"]
    RA --> RB["Only the gap is re-sent, not the file"]
